msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-dependencies/urllib3.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; urllib3</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-dependencies/urllib3.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Assuming <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> is installed, but the other optional "
"dependencies are not, the installation can be tested with the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""

#.  no && because of a possible error
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-dependencies/urllib3.xml:131
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install --group dev                       &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 /usr/bin/pytest --timeout 10\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-dependencies/urllib3.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"More than 50 failures are expected with the instructions above. There are "
"several reasons. First, upstream uses a patched version of the hypercorn "
"module for their own testing, that can only be obtained through "
"<command>git</command> at <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/urllib3/hypercorn.git\">https://github.com/urllib3/hypercorn.git</ulink>,"
" at revision <quote>urllib3-changes</quote>, and should be installed first "
"in the virtual environment. Second, it seems the test suite has not been "
"adapted to recent versions of Python, and to recent versions of the external"
" Python modules. In particular, some tests will hang, so "
"<command>pytest</command> needs the <parameter>--timeout</parameter> switch."
msgstr ""

